{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_91_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"一、二十有八年，春，晉侯侵曹，晉侯伐衞。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"再稱晉侯，忌也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"二、公子買戍衞，不卒戍，刺之。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"先名後刺，殺有罪也。公子啟曰：「不卒戍者，可以卒也。可以卒而不卒，譏在公子也，刺之可也。」","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"三、楚人救衞。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"四、三月，丙午，晉侯入曹，執曹伯。畀宋人。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"入者，內弗受也。日入，惡入者也。以晉侯而斥執曹伯，惡晉侯也。畀，與也。其曰人何也？不以晉侯畀宋公也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"五、夏，四月，己巳，晉侯、齊師、宋師、秦師及楚人戰於城濮，楚師敗績。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"六、楚殺其大夫得臣。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"七、衞侯出奔楚。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"八、五月，癸丑，公會晉侯、齊侯、宋公、蔡侯、鄭伯、衞子、莒子，盟於踐土。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"諱會天王也。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"九、陳侯如會。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"如會，外乎會也，於會受命也。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"十、公朝於王所。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"朝不言所，言所者，非其所也。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_17","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"十一、六月，衞侯鄭自楚復歸於衞。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_18","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"自楚，楚有奉焉爾。復者，復中國也。歸者，歸其所也。鄭之名，失國也。衞元咺出奔晉。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_19","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"十二、陳侯款卒。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_20","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"十三、秋，杞伯姬來。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_21","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"十四、公子遂如齊。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_22","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"十五、冬，公會晉侯、齊侯、宋公、蔡侯、鄭伯、陳子、莒子、邾子、秦人於溫。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_23","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"諱會天王也。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_24","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"十六、天王守於河陽。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_25","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"全天王之行也。為若將守而遇諸侯之朝也，為天王諱也。水北為陽，山南為陽。溫，河陽也。","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_26","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"十七、壬申，公朝於王所。","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_27","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"朝於廟，禮也。於外，非禮也。獨公朝？與諸侯盡朝也。其日，以其再致天子，故謹而日之也。主善以內，目惡以外。言曰公朝，逆辭也，而尊天子。會於溫，言小諸侯。溫，河北地，以河陽言之，大天子也。日繫於月，月繫於時。壬申，公朝於王所，其不月，失其所繫也。以為晉文公之行事，為已顛矣！","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_28","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"十八、晉人執衞侯，歸之於京師。衞元咺自晉復歸於衞。","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_29","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"此入而執，其不言入何也？不外王命於衞也。歸之於京師，緩辭也，斷在京師也。自晉，晉有奉焉爾。復者，復中國也。歸者，歸其所也。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_30","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"十九、諸侯遂圍許。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_31","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"遂，繼事也。","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_32","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"二十、曹伯襄復歸於曹，遂會諸侯圍許。","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_clt_91_33","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_91","textTraditional":"復者，復中國也。天子免之，因與之會。其曰復，通王命也。遂，繼事也。","sentenceOrder":33}],"overrides":{}}